"Wait for the current scan or cleanup to finish before moving backups." = "請等待目前的掃描或清理完成，再移動備份。";
"Finishing backup removal. New scans are available when it stops." = "正在完成備份移除。結束後即可開始新的掃描。";
"Moving backups to the Trash does not free disk space. Emptying the Trash is a separate action." = "移到垃圾桶的備份仍會占用空間，清空垃圾桶後才會釋出。";
"Backup removal was cancelled. Remaining backups were left in place." = "已取消移除備份，其餘備份保留在原處。";
"Dismiss report" = "關閉報告";

